# Legacy classifier regression fixture: named answer vocabulary with explicit negative exceptions.
// This intentionally retains the old reduction lane to test emitted classifier parity.
// New authoring uses Record + value domain + shape reduction, as in the Bleph acceptance fixture.
// Codes, systems and displays belong to the named terminology; all offered answers qualify except none.
library "Coded Question Reference".

// The gate. A bare `code is` boolean: nothing derives it, so unanswered it is UNKNOWN — not false.
concept "Service Requested":
- shape is Scalar.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `service-requested`.

// ⭐ THE CODED QUESTION. `shape is Record` + `most recent this` means it publishes ONE record: the newest
// answer wins, so a later answer overrides an earlier one.
concept "Documented Symptom":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- code is `documented-symptom`.
- definition is most recent this.
- value from is "Coded Question Reference Documented Symptom Answer Options":
  - not qualifying is `none-of-listed`.

// ⭐ THE PREDICATE. No `type is`: this is an ephemeral derivation — it publishes a computed boolean, emits no
// resource, and gets no case-feature StructureDefinition.
concept "Qualifying Symptom Documented":
- shape is Scalar.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "Documented Symptom" in qualifying.

activity "certify.Met":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `APPROVED`.

activity "not-certify.Unmet":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `NOT APPROVED`.

decision "Coverage Determination":
first:
- when "Service Requested" then:
    first:
    - when "Qualifying Symptom Documented" then recommend activity "certify.Met".
    - otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Unmet".
    end.
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Unmet".


terminology "Coded Question Reference Documented Symptom Answer Options":
- system is `https://example.org/answer-codes`.
- code is `functional-limitation` display is `Functional limitation affecting daily activity`.
- code is `persistent-pain` display is `Persistent pain despite conservative therapy`.
- code is `none-of-listed` display is `None of the listed symptoms is documented`.
